# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# Types: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, chore, revert
# Scope: ui, db, auth, gradle, mileage-calc, etc.
# Subject: Imperative mood, max 50 chars (e.g., "add dark mode support")
#
# Example: feat(ui): add material 3 dynamic color support

# Body: Explain *what* and *why* (not how). Wrap at 72 chars.
#

# Footer: Refer to issues (e.g., "Closes #123") or breaking changes.
#